This file replaced a symlink when the repository was published.

v1.0 resolved the reference catalogue through a symlink at this path. On the
machine that built the published matrices it pointed at the Carter
(Hadza_UHGG) catalogue. That target was an absolute path on that machine,
reproducible nowhere else, so it was replaced with this note.

This is NOT a FASTA file, and the Quick Start cannot be followed from inside
a v1.x tag. To reproduce the published matrices, build the catalogue with
build_references.py from `main` -- it checks every contig name and length
against a manifest, which the original never did -- and point
config/config.yaml at the result.
